    {
      "id": "e791740914",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 18,
      "y": 243.25,
      "width": 422.29,
      "height": 65.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2058278588,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 167435849,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786900000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "kit_on_time_delivery_rate = kits_on_time / kits_shipped. BOTH\nsides are gated on is_mature_sla: the numerator counts kits\nactivated inside the 10-day SLA and matured, the denominator\ncounts every matured kit.",
      "originalText": "kit_on_time_delivery_rate = kits_on_time / kits_shipped. BOTH\nsides are gated on is_mature_sla: the numerator counts kits\nactivated inside the 10-day SLA and matured, the denominator\ncounts every matured kit.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "e1469936978",
      "type": "text",
