      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "An unweighted mean across states is not the national rate --\nstates differ in volume by two orders of magnitude (California\n1,489 matured kits, New Jersey 23). Quote the pooled rate, or\nsay explicitly that the figure is a state mean.",
      "originalText": "An unweighted mean across states is not the national rate --\nstates differ in volume by two orders of magnitude (California\n1,489 matured kits, New Jersey 23). Quote the pooled rate, or\nsay explicitly that the figure is a state mean.",
