      "text": "Loss is a distinct failure from lateness and has a distinct\nowner -- a lost kit is a carrier claim, a late kit is a\nrouting problem.",
      "originalText": "Loss is a distinct failure from lateness and has a distinct\nowner -- a lost kit is a carrier claim, a late kit is a\nrouting problem.",
