      "updated": 1786900000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "A categorical threshold must reduce direction-aware: max for\nan 'above' rule, min for a 'below' one. Taking the\nalphabetically-last row recorded Virginia at 0.0 while Ohio\nsat at 0.0724 -- that single bug silenced seven thresholds at\nonce. The segment must travel with the value.",
      "originalText": "A categorical threshold must reduce direction-aware: max for\nan 'above' rule, min for a 'below' one. Taking the\nalphabetically-last row recorded Virginia at 0.0 while Ohio\nsat at 0.0724 -- that single bug silenced seven thresholds at\nonce. The segment must travel with the value.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
